WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.314 line:8%
Open Staff and choose Invite a team member.

00:00:03.314 --> 00:00:06.214 line:8%
Enter their details and the appropriate role.

00:00:07.219 --> 00:00:11.596 line:8%
Choose their programmes or intakes and delegated capabilities.

00:00:11.596 --> 00:00:14.332 line:8%
Review the invitation before saving.

00:00:15.346 --> 00:00:19.919 line:8%
Use Edit access for changes and Deactivate when access must end.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:22.829 line:8%
Keep at least one active Super Admin.
